# Environment Variables — RepoPulse Lite

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your values.
`.env.local` is listed in `.gitignore` and will never be committed.

## GitHub API

# Optional: Personal Access Token to increase rate limits from 60 to 5,000 req/hr.
# Leave empty to use unauthenticated access (60 req/hr).
GITHUB_TOKEN=

## LLM (OpenAI-compatible)

# Required for executive risk report generation.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the API base URL for compatible providers (e.g. Azure OpenAI, Ollama).
# Defaults to https://api.openai.com/v1 when not set.
OPENAI_BASE_URL=

# Optional: model name to use. Defaults to gpt-4o when not set.
OPENAI_MODEL=
